:: Noah Hang Out End Early High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> is happily jumping and skipping behind you, humming to himself as he follows along in anticipation of what’s next on your fun-filled agenda. <span style="color:LightGreen">Based on his expression, he is having the best day ever hanging out with his big bro and just can’t wait to have more fun!</span> Which makes this next part a little sad, as you explain that it is time to call it quits and for him to head home. <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha- what!? Why!? D- did I do something wrong? I’m sorry, I’ll be quiet! Promise!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> stammers out, pleading and trying to figure out how to make your day last longer. You laugh and kneel down next to your little brother, telling him that he didn’t do anything wrong. It’s just your hang out time is coming to an end. You have other things to do, and he should be getting home. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But- but…!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s lip quivers as he pouts. <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Promise to hang out again soon<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You sigh, giving <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> a pat on the head. You ask him if he had fun and he nods softly. You tell your little brother that he has to understand that things end, but that doesn’t mean he should be sad about it. <span style="color:LightGreen">Afterall, now he can think about all the fun you had together and think about what fun stuff the two of you will do next time!</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Next time…?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> questions softly. You nod; you promise to hang out with him again soon. You have to! Afterall, you had a lot of fun too! So, he should cheer up and show you a big smile. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> ponders your words for a moment before giving a shy smile. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Okay, but you have to promise we’ll hang out again soon. Okay?”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">You laugh and agree, giving <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> a pinky promise that you’ll both play together again very soon.</span> <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> perks up at this and nods. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Okay! I’ll head home then. Thanks for playing with me, you’re the best!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> gives you a big hug before running off. What a cute kid.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Say he can only stick around if he’s in his underwear<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You sigh, pondering for a moment about how to get <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> to leave without causing a scene. You love spending time with your little brother, but he also doesn’t take play time ending very well. Then, a funny idea hits your brain, and you can’t hide your smile. You tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> that you’ll stick around and play with him a little longer, on one condition. <br>
        <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Noah",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 2,
                Arms: "Hide",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You will?”</span> You swear you see <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span>’s ears twitch at this, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“What? I’ll do anything!”</span> You laugh, it’s simply really. <span style="color:Pink">You’ll stay out here, in public, and play with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> as long as he is in his underwear. Just his underwear. That way it’ll be too funny for you to leave. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> instantly blushes at this requirement.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Wha-!? I- I can’t be in my underwear out here! People will see me and laugh!”</span> You say that’s your one condition. <span style="color:Pink">Embarrassment for playtime. Either he strips or he heads home. It’s his choice.</span> <br>
        <br>
        Now, you only said this since you know your shy little brother wouldn’t actually agree to wander around the town in just his undies. <span style="color:Pink">But, for a brief moment as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> hesitates and reaches for his bottoms, you actually think he is going to do it!</span> Until he sighs and gives you a playful smile. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine! I’ll go home. You meanie!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Noah</span> sticks out his tongue at you before running off laughing. What a cute kid.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>